{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Artin 环”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Artin环"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Artin 环是满足理想的降链性质的环. (这里的环是指交换环.)</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>设 $k$ 为域. $k[x]/(x^n)$ 是 Artin 环.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Artin对象","text":"Artin 对象"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}